BT 1 0 0 1 0 171 Tm 12 TL /F1 9 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Herbert Frohlich \(1968\) predicted that biological macromolecules under metabolic energy pumping should exhibit coherent) Tj T* (collective vibrations -- a Bose-Einstein-like condensation of vibrational quanta into the lowest frequency mode. The) Tj T* (AIIT-THRESI framework provides the natural home for this prediction: Frohlich condensation is precisely decoherence) Tj T* (suppression in the Lindblad master equation sense. This paper derives the condensation threshold from the Lindblad) Tj T* (equation, connects the condensate directly to gamma_eff reduction in the Wike Coherence Law, and computes quantitative) Tj T* (predictions using only published biological parameters \(tubulin dipole moment, brain metabolic rate, microtubule geometry\).) Tj T* (Key results: \(1\) The Frohlich condensation threshold is P_c = gamma_damp -- pumping rate equals damping rate -- exact) Tj T* (from Lindblad, no free parameters. \(2\) At threshold, gamma_eff for the condensate mode -) Tj (> 0 -- the condensate is a) Tj T* (decoherence-free subspace. \(3\) A single neuron's microtubule complement \(N ~ 10^8-10^9 dimers\) is within one order of) Tj T* -0.010105 Tw (magnitude of the collective threshold \(N_c ~ 4x10^8\). Neurons operate at the Frohlich edge. \(4\) At the FCC public exposure) Tj T* 0 Tw (limit for 28 GHz \(10 W/m^2\), mmWave-tubulin coupling delivers ~50% of a Frohlich quantum -- non-negligible. The sign of) Tj T* (the biological effect \(beneficial vs harmful\) depends on whether the external frequency is at resonance with the individual's) Tj T* (Frohlich mode: resonant coupling reinforces the condensate \(DELTAgamma_eff < 0\); off-resonant coupling disrupts it) Tj T* (\(DELTAgamma_eff > 0\). This is a falsifiable, quantitative prediction. Frohlich was not wrong. He was working without the) Tj T* (right framework to close the numbers.) Tj T* ET
